  unitName: Geomancer Claris
  unitId: 30040
  unitNumber: 59
  description: A geomancer active from the ruined Vriksha Duchy. As she was from
    a nomadic tribe, there are few records of her youth. A geomancer deciphers and
    manipulates nature. Claris was rarely in any one place for very long, but spent
    10 years in Vriksha. Her purpose is unclear, but rumors are she was searching
    for buried treasure or that she had a lover.
  summonDesc: I've been waiting for you.<br>I will show you the<br>ideal direction
    in which to head.
  fusionDesc: Amazing, isn't it?<br>I can feel the flow of <br>righteous energy.
